### 2. `vercel.json`
*(Create this file in your root folder. It tells Vercel how to map your Express API requests and static public assets)*

```json
{
  "version": 2,
  "builds": [
    {
      "src": "server.js",
      "use": "@vercel/node"
    }
  ],
  "routes": [
    {
      "src": "/api/(.*)",
      "dest": "server.js"
    },
    {
      "src": "/(.*)",
      "dest": "/public/$1"
    }
  ]
}